      "text": "Two starts, two SyGs for Alfie Prygodzicz. Not a bad start to life in the SRC for the academy flanker!\nShould be playing BUCS Super Rugby but called up due to injury and looking very comfortable as a physical defensive presence and dynamic attacker.",
