      "text": "We're finally back home this Saturday and there's loads to look forward to before the game even kicks off! 🙌\nEnjoy a pint at the new Fanzone or welcome the team as they make their way in. Just make sure you're in your seat for the Homecoming  Ceremony! ✨\nSee what's on 👉 https://bit.ly/4yAEplK",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mx7vrpbpty2i",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T17:00:25.272Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreiep3lhallnpk4lbb3rujuj77ruve7xcalwuoyel5dnva3xzdlikiy",
      "source": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:MTKRan8tT6g",
      "title": "Highlights | Munster Rugby v Vodacom Bulls",
      "author": "Munster Rugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MTKRan8tT6g",
