    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:YSKXXV_ae8g",
      "title": "How well do you know 1996?  #rugby  #edinburghrugby #quiz #1996 #90s #funny",
      "author": "Edinburgh Rugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YSKXXV_ae8g",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T14:05:42.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/YSKXXV_ae8g/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UC5QfHoca5UPU3IU8XRw6FWg"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx772idrgs2m",
      "text": "For our latest pod I was joined by Rich Mifsud & Hugo Gordon and we harped on…\n🏉 Sharks v Leinster wrap\n🏉 Academy & the future\n🏉 Weekend roundup\n🏉 Munster’s challenges\n🏉 Naming rights…and wrongs\nCheck it out here > harpinonrugby.blog/2026/10/06/5...",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mx772idrgs2m",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T10:13:44.045Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiftwz4rpy3wqybohfw4czmegthshxhbky62dh6z5ruegvefegi36a",
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx75nhouwc2g",
      "text": "This week's Substack: Kane James was mentioned as a breakout player for Exeter during pre-season. Has started hot, and here's why.\ntheofffieldreview.substack.com/p/kane-james...\nPlus notes on Gloucester, Sale, a missed chance for Newcastle, and Rees-Zammit being very much a wing.",
      "author": "Ben Coles",
      "handle": "bencoles.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreihnbnflj5pmzn2vw5tula7bf7hay7nsutvg5e7suz6y2bnoob5p2a",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bencoles.bsky.social/post/3mx75nhouwc2g",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T09:48:33.413Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Akbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreif233f4dbiflmiulndyvoca6rylnwfgcakgqddxpvvmom24y42gwi/thumbnail.jpg",
      "source": "bencoles.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "youtube",
      "id": "yt:iSdaazlamf0",
      "title": "Una passione biancoverde senza confini 🤍💚",
      "author": "BenettonRugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iSdaazlamf0",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T09:19:46.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/iSdaazlamf0/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UCZWp6Nb9Rk6w6Dz_O_2nHqw"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:sj3xev6exp6xronoyolo3l4m/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx4ki7j3js2u",
      "text": "What a weekend of results in the urc!!!\nWe break it all down on this week's podcast!!\n#BKTURC #IrishRugby\nyoutu.be/WXyx-Sf2JNE",
      "author": "The 2nd Row",
      "handle": "the2ndrow.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:sj3xev6exp6xronoyolo3l4m/bafkreiazut3bcdskefwftkflzwbla4h6q56u7xutxhdmmhk4unffwpjl4e",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/the2ndrow.bsky.social/post/3mx4ki7j3js2u",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-05T09:00:16.484Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:sj3xev6exp6xronoyolo3l4m/bafkreiaxazkjmls4w6ri4qodokhcrot7nlrhgoa3sbg5rniram2h6vxvlm",
      "source": "the2ndrow.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx3c75l6w22h",
      "text": "JP Pietersen reflects on Leinster win",
      "author": "The Leinster Playbook",
      "handle": "lplaybook.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/bafkreigindvb7f6skkn3rjvjebp3pnkmcq2chdzvfyslpzqvymmoex2w5e",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lplaybook.bsky.social/post/3mx3c75l6w22h",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T20:59:22.792Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/bafkreiem7azpkbbdjkzzhonbujqvd277o3c6dmrm7bno7f6ktcmuujy2sq",
      "source": "lplaybook.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwzygnmjbc2b",
      "text": "On Sunday mornings we share our notes from our feature match on Substack, including real-time screengrabs from our WhatsApp group throughout > jeffpagano.substack.com/p/sharks-v-l...",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwzygnmjbc2b",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T08:31:57.342Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreifzpg4mayqknnuoplfgt64wqthe3thrwcd4htear6yep3sotqudhm",
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyiydwoyc2w",
      "text": "Second week in a row we pulled a late try out of the bag.  In the end it wasn't the scrums that did for us, could have won that with more accuracy in 22 but again plenty to be happy with, esp Sam's shift.  Thought Sharks might have gotten 2nd half card but still deserved win.  #SHAvLEI",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwyiydwoyc2w",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:22:51.564Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyilu3av2un",
      "text": "Good BP win for the Sharks against Leinster. Champs came back in the third quarter, but the returning Boks made a big impact at the death.\nLeinster head back to Ireland with 3 log points from 2 matches.",
      "author": "Jon Cardinelli",
      "handle": "joncardinelli.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/bafkreicmmiirqk2ft7xymnjwhs66pxlm4ttg4u2v7vqg26qpvuchxm5nri",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/joncardinelli.bsky.social/post/3mwyilu3av2un",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:15:52.284Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "joncardinelli.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyiadnr7k2t",
      "text": "Not convinced \"driven backwards by Jamie Dobie\" is a phrase you'd ever want to hear used about yourself",
      "author": "Scottish Rugby Podcast",
      "handle": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/bafkreifbllydjgwnuwniseg4xdzqgul2n6mvpnva2ybemkowieg7tp4h7u",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotrugbypod.bsky.social/post/3mwyiadnr7k2t",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:09:25.966Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyhzi7xx22w",
      "text": "How many Sharks penalties since the warning? #SHAvLEI",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwyhzi7xx22w",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:05:35.874Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwydxbtl3k2t",
      "text": "Big Staff deciding to back the fact that he was twice the size of the defender instead of giving it to one of the TWO faster guys either side of him butchered a stuck on try there.\nYou never go Full Duhan",
      "author": "Scottish Rugby Podcast",
      "handle": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/bafkreifbllydjgwnuwniseg4xdzqgul2n6mvpnva2ybemkowieg7tp4h7u",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotrugbypod.bsky.social/post/3mwydxbtl3k2t",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T16:52:47.101Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
